<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 44-day seasonal T-bills yield 7.409 pct.</title>
<headline>NZ 44-day seasonal T-bills yield 7.409 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$150 million of 44-day seasonal Treasury bills was 7.409 percent, the Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$3990 million.</p>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$150 million of 77-day seasonal bills was 7.269 percent, with bids totalling $410 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
